# <%= projectName %>

<% if (kind === 'domain') { %>Domain remote for **<%= label %>** (family: `<%= family %>`). It exposes `./Routes`, and the shell mounts it at `/<%= route %>`.
Users need the `<%= entitlement %>` entitlement to see it.<% } else { %>Capability remote **<%= label %>**. It exposes `./<%= exposedName %>`: one standalone component with `caseId` and `caseType` inputs.
Case layouts mount it as a tab or panel through `CaseTabDefinition` (`remote: '<%= projectName %>', exposedModule: './<%= exposedName %>'`).<% } %>

| | |
| --- | --- |
| Tags | `<%= tags.join('`, `') %>` |
| Local port | <%= port %> |
| Standalone | `nx serve <%= projectName %>` → http://localhost:<%= port %> (dev harness on mocks) |
| In the shell | `npm run start:all` → http://localhost:4200<% if (kind === 'domain') { %>/<%= route %><% } %> |
| Build | `nx build <%= projectName %>` (production), `-c mock` (dev environment) |
| Pipeline | [`.gitlab-ci.yml`](./.gitlab-ci.yml). To run on its own: start a pipeline with `APP=<%= projectName %>` |

## Rules
- Import only `scope:shared` libs<% if (family === 'case') { %> and `libs/case-workspace`<% } else if (family === '360') { %> and `libs/layout-360`<% } %>. Never another app ([ADR-0002](../../docs/platform-handbook.md#adr-0002)).
- No global CSS. Use `@org/design-system` components and `--ds-*` tokens.
- `@platform/mocks` may be imported only from `src/start-mocks.ts` and specs.
<% if (kind === 'capability') { %>- Never read the route or another MFE's state. Everything you need comes from `caseId` and `caseType` ([ADR-0004](../../docs/platform-handbook.md#adr-0004)).<% } %>
